SUMMARY:DJ Aziz's Birthday Bash - Music\, Dancing and Socializing at a Chi
 ll Venue
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nCome experience a night at Night
 shade in Asheville’s South Slope featuring DJ Aziz Vora’s birthday bas
 h. Aziz is an amazing house DJ known for bringing great vibes that keep pe
 ople dancing all night. The night will also feature RickiiRain bringing ad
 ditional immersive electronic sounds and energy to the lineup. Expect an i
 ncredible sound system\, creative drinks including CBD-infused options\, a
 nd a stylish lounge atmosphere built for music\, connection\, and dancing.
  Nightshade has quickly become one of Asheville’s most unique nightlife 
 spots with its modern design and intimate social vibe.\n\nI just put the M
 eetup for 2 hours but they'll be open until 2:00am if you want to stay lat
 e.\n\n$5–$15 \\| 21\\+ \\| 9:30 PM\n\nHope to see you there!
